@page "/"
@page "/portal"
@layout DefaultLayout

<PageTitle>门户</PageTitle>

<div class="row">
    <div class="col-12">
        <div class="card shadow-sm mb-4">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h1 class="card-title">欢迎来到门户系统</h1>
                <p class="card-text">这是一个独立的门户界面，拥有顶部的贴边菜单导航。</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row">
    <div class="col-md-4">
        <div class="card mb-4">
            <div class="card-header bg-primary text-white">功能模块 1</div>
            <div class="card-body">
                <p>这里可以放置门户的各种快捷功能或信息展示。</p>
                <button class="btn btn-primary">查看详情</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-4">
        <div class="card mb-4">
            <div class="card-header bg-success text-white">最新动态</div>
            <div class="card-body">
                <p>展示系统的最新公告或动态更新。</p>
                <button class="btn btn-success">了解更多</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-4">
        <div class="card mb-4">
            <div class="card-header bg-info text-white">系统统计</div>
            <div class="card-body">
                <p>展示门户相关的数据统计图表或概览。</p>
                <button class="btn btn-info">进入报表</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>